        },
        {
          "text": "K'omaki jacwo nindo gi cipa nyawote, joje joripo tho, jacwo m'onindo gi dhako no kiri gi dhako no. Ameno wilakwanyo woko reco no i Isiraili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.22",
