        },
        {
          "text": "Ka jacwo oromo gi nyako mambula ma k'obedo ombego pa jacwo man, aka omako go to nindo gi go, t'inwaŋo jo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.28",
