        },
        {
          "text": "jacwo no ripo miyo kilo 0.6 ma feza ri ba nyako, aka labedo dhako pere. Kwoŋbedo jacwo no okwoto wi nyako no aka kilayeyo go riemo woko go ka go fodi kwo.",
